      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚡ 2022 — THE CEILING\n\n500K jobs/day\n70K workflows\n\nAWS instance limit hit.\nNo vertical left.\n\n00:00 UTC spike nightly\nCause: engineers\ncopy-pasted cron from\nNetflix's own docs\n\nPaged. Every. Night.",
